## **Quick Reference: Connection String Updates**

You'll need to update [src/main/java/db/DBConnection.java](src/main/java/db/DBConnection.java):

**Current (Local):**
```
jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/railwaydb
```

**After Azure Deployment:**
```
jdbc:mysql://railwaydb.mysql.database.azure.com:3306/railwaydb?useSSL=true&requireSSL=true
```

